 "title": "Local Option Sales Tax (LOST) | Meeker County, MN - Official Website",
 "text": "Local Option Sales Tax (LOST) | Meeker County, MN - Official Website\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nAlert!\nMEEKER COUNTY HAS A NEW WEB ADDRESS\nRead On For Details...\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nServices\nOur County\nHow Do I...?\n-->\nHome\nGovernment\nGovernment Offices\nHighway\nLocal Option Sales Tax (LOST)\nLocal Option Sales Tax (LOST)\nMeeker County has implemented a 0.5% Local Option Sales Tax (LOST) for transportation effective July 1, 2026.\nLocal Option Sales Tax for Transportation\nOn February 3, 2026, the Meeker County Board of Commissioners adopted Resolution 2026-4 Approving a Transportation Sales and Use Tax to fund transportation projects. This Local Option Sales Tax (LOST) will generate an estimated $1.3 million with an estimated 35-44 percent of the total expected to be coming from non-Meeker County residents. (Please note that purchases of goods and services made outside the political subdivision that are used in the political subdivision, are subject to Meeker County use taxes.) The funds raised by this LOST will be allocated to the high-priority projects as detailed in the list below.\nA Public Hearing was held at the February 3, 2026, County Board meeting. Information previously presented to the County Board may be viewed below:\nMeeker County Local Option Sales Tax (LOST) Related Documents:\nLOST Public Hearing Presentation\nLOST Resolution 2026-4\nLOST Projects Listing\nLOST Projects Map\nMN Department of Revenue local tax information\nMN Dept. of Revenue Meeker County Sales & Use Tax\nEmail the Meeker County Treasurer’s Office with any questions or comments or call 320-693-5345.\nAbout Us\nBid Letting\nMaps\nPermits and Forms\nRoad Construction\nRoad Maintenance\nGIS\nAdopt- A-Highway Program\nLocal Option Sales Tax (LOST)\nSign up for Updates\nApply for Employment\nPay Online\nReserve a Facility\nTax & Parcel Search\n-->\nAll photos by Robyn Richardson\nContact Us\n114 N Holcombe Ave. Ste 160\nLitchfield, MN 55355\nStaff Directory\nCounty Facebook Pages\nEconomic Development\nHistorical Society\nHumane Society\nMeeker County\nOffice of the Meeker County Sheriff\nMeeker County Public Works\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHOME\nSITE MAP\nACCESSIBILITY\nCOPYRIGHT NOTICES\nGOVERNMENT WEBSITES BY CIVICPLUS®\n/QuickLinks.aspx\n-->\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
